     A*  Claims Eligibility File
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  Created on 08/16/2007 by C:62 for Project:MC300
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  Purpose: This file is extracted from WCMS claims selecting
     A*           open claims.
     A*           It will be used to determine whether a Claimant's
     A*           monthly prescriptions are for their Injury, or other
     A*           medical issues outside of the On the Job Injury
     A*           and/or WC Coverage.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
